<MainLayout title="About GameToolHub" description="Learn about GameToolHub, an independent collection of gaming utilities.">
<section class="page-hero container content"><span class="pill">ABOUT US</span><h1>Tools made for <span class="gradient-text">players.</span></h1><p>GameToolHub is an independent project creating simple, accessible utilities and references for video game players.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We aim to make tools that are clear, fast and useful. We label limitations where game data may vary by version, edition or update.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>GameToolHub is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Pocketpair, Mojang Studios or Microsoft. All game names are used only to identify the games the tools relate to.</p></section>
</MainLayout>
